@startuml 27_timing_heartbeat
title Host freshness after approved pairing (illustrative; 1 unit = 10 s)
robust "Host reporting state" as H
@0
H is PENDING
@1
H is CONNECTED
@2
H is CONNECTED
@3
H is CONNECTED
@7
H is STALE
@8
H is CONNECTED
legend bottom
  Registration occurs after operator-approved pairing.
  Accepted reports at t=10, 20, 30 and 80 seconds.
  At t=70 the last accepted report is 40s old,
  exceeding the 35-second stale threshold.
  A revocation supersedes both CONNECTED and STALE.
  STALE does not establish physical machine shutdown.
endlegend
@enduml
